---
Make drum grid scrollable. (Partially done)

When there are more tracks or steps than fit on screen, the drum grid
should scroll vertically (tracks) and horizontally (steps).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Vertical scroll when tracks exceed visible area
- [ ] Horizontal scroll when steps exceed visible area (64-step patterns)
- [ ] Scroll bars or scroll wheel support
- [ ] Current playhead position stays visible during playback
- [ ] Grid layout stable during scroll

## Test Plan
- [ ] Create 16 tracks, verify vertical scrolling works
- [ ] Create 64-step pattern, verify horizontal scrolling works
- [ ] Play pattern, verify playhead visible as it advances
- [ ] Scroll to edge, verify no rendering glitches
